id: warrior-buddy
name: Warrior Buddy
kind: gear
itemType: buddy
special: true
buddyKind: greater
original: assault-buddy
chooses: profileOrTechnique
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Greater Assault Buddy: a Signature Technique of 25 TP instead of a Profile.
text: >
  Warrior Buddy: This particular helper is especially suited to combat.
  –Special Buddy Type: Greater
  –Original Buddy: Assault Buddy
  –Effects: Instead of a Profile, you may create a Signature Technique with a TP Cost of 25. Use
  that Signature Technique instead for the effects of the Buddy.

---

# The Technique is built with the usual builder and chosen when it is given - or a Profile, as
# the Assault Buddy's: "you may". Its 25 TP is the table's; nothing here sums a Technique's TP. It
# is the Buddy's, usable only through it, by the table's ruling.
